{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>Let the waters be gathered.</b> Not that they dried up, as many supposed, saying that the exposed portion of the earth dried by the power of the heavenly arrangements. Rather, He commanded that they gather to one place and not pass beyond it — and thus they are elevated above the earth and do not fall upon it, as sense attests, as it says: גְּבוּל שַׂמְתָּ בַּל יַעֲבֹרוּן בַּל יְשׁוּבוּן לְכַסּוֹת הָאָרֶץ (Psalms 104:9)."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:11:37.177450242Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}